Audit complete. The retry buttons and busy/disabled states were already correctly labeled. The one real gap: the status summary's `accessibilityLabel`/`accessibilityLiveRegion` lived on the outer `View`, which lacked `accessible={true}` — on iOS that means VoiceOver would never read it (and the Android-only `importantForAccessibility="no"` hides on the children wouldn't help there). Fixed by moving the summary role/label onto a new inner wrapper around just the status texts, keeping the retry buttons as independent siblings so they stay individually focusable on both platforms. `tsc --noEmit` shows zero errors in the file. RESULT written to `tasks/admin-queue/done/079-conn-pill-a11y-RESULT.md`.
